        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 331FL, Classico Collection Ornate Florence Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Florence Leverset features exquisite detailing that not only is reminiscent of the old-world, but does it in a beautiful and modern way. Enhance the lavishness of any room with this Omnia made 331FL Door Lever. It has concealed screw mounting. Available in 4 finishes, all of which are designed to highlight the beautiful details. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass (pictured), Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel. Part of Omnia's new Classic Collection, the Ornate Florence Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" thick doors with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-ornate-deadbolt-omnia-flordb\">Matching Single Cylinder Deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Florence Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 331FL Florence Lever and Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>55 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Lever Functions are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Florence Leverset",
                "description": "The Florence Leverset features exquisite detailing that not only is reminiscent of the old-world, but does it in a beautiful and modern way. Enhance the lavishness of any room with this Omnia made 331FL Door Lever. It has concealed screw mounting. Available in 4 finishes, all of which are designed to highlight the beautiful details. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel. Part of Omnia's new Classic Collection, the Ornate Florence Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Classico Collection Ornate Florence Levers, OMN-331FL, Florence Leversets, Omnia 331FL, Omnia 331FL Florence Lever and Roses, ornate levers, ornate leversets, ornate door levers, Omnia Classico Collection, passage levers, privacy levers,"
